silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_r1 silm:hasExample "In 'Replica1ForColimit', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, R_1 is the morning vet-visit replica for Mittens — contains the vaccination record and morning weight. It contributes via mu_1 to R_vee and via nu_1 to VetCarePlan_77.." .
